//
// Level 2 (edge) demo ROMs: make DEMO=l2-<name>. The measurement code is
// Corvane's (games/corvane/arm9/source/demo/demo.c); here every demo writes its
// result block at frame 120 with the FNV-1a id of its prefixed name
// ("l2-sys-irq", ...), and the pictures the 2D demos need are generated by code
// at run time (no asset files, no NitroFS). tools/judge.py grades the blocks as
// boots "l2-<name>" of expected.json.

